但有趣的地方来了。

642
00:26:53.060 --> 00:26:54.160
Guess what it is today?
你猜它现在是什么？

643
00:26:55.940 --> 00:26:56.720
Not a bar?
不是酒吧吗？

644
00:26:56.880 --> 00:26:58.180
You're not going to be able to guess.
你绝对猜不到。

645
00:26:58.540 --> 00:26:59.360
What is it?
是什么？

646
00:26:59.520 --> 00:27:03.280
Well, first of all, the people that bought it restored all of it.
嗯，首先，买下它的人把里面全都修复了。

647
00:27:03.280 --> 00:27:08.160
It really meant a lot to them to restore the integrity of the structure, the stained glass.
对他们来说，恢复建筑的完整性以及彩绘玻璃至关重要。

648
00:27:08.280 --> 00:27:15.540
But it is partly a gym called the Complete Body Limelight, so you can lift weights inside the church.
但它现在一部分是一家叫“完美身材光芒”的健身房，所以你可以在教堂里举铁。

649
00:27:16.060 --> 00:27:16.160
Okay.
好吧。

650
00:27:16.160 --> 00:27:21.900
And then the chapel is a modern dim sum restaurant called Julan Club.
然后原本的小礼拜堂变成了一家名为“聚兰俱乐部”的现代点心餐厅。

651
00:27:21.900 --> 00:27:25.300
So you can go work out and then get some dim sum.
这样你就可以去健身，然后再去吃点点心。

652
00:27:26.600 --> 00:27:27.500
Let's do it.
我们走吧。

653
00:27:27.640 --> 00:27:28.580
Let's do it.
我们走吧。

654
00:27:28.920 --> 00:27:30.080
I love that.
我太喜欢这样了。

655
00:27:30.360 --> 00:27:36.820
I just found it fascinating because as soon as he said that, Jenna, when do I ever know about any bars or pop culture stuff?
我觉得这太神奇了，因为他刚说完那句话时，珍娜，我什么时候了解过什么酒吧或流行文化的东西？

656
00:27:37.080 --> 00:27:37.520
Never.
从不。

657
00:27:37.960 --> 00:27:38.400
Never.
从不。

658
00:27:38.560 --> 00:27:38.780
Nothing.
什么都不知道。

659
00:27:39.100 --> 00:27:40.160
You know nothing about them.
你对这些一无所知。

660
00:27:40.280 --> 00:27:42.520
And not only did I know, but I had been there.
而且我不但知道，我还去过那儿。

661
00:27:43.480 --> 00:27:44.820
That's pretty badass.
那可真是酷毙了。

662
00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:45.760
I know.
我知道。

663
00:27:46.000 --> 00:27:50.680
I went with Debbie and her boyfriend at the time who was an exterminator.
我是和黛比以及她当时的男朋友一起去的，他是个灭虫员。

664
00:27:50.940 --> 00:27:51.300
Oh.
噢。

665
00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:51.780
Yeah.
是啊。

666
00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:53.140
And Debbie, it's okay if I say this right.
黛比，我说这个没关系吧。

667
00:27:53.200 --> 00:27:58.960
In the cab ride home, you and him started making out and I had to sit awkwardly looking out the window.
在回家的出租车上，你俩开始卿卿我我，我只能尴尬地坐在那儿看着窗外。

668
00:27:59.560 --> 00:28:01.380
That sounds like they had a good time.
听起来他们玩得很开心。

669
00:28:01.520 --> 00:28:03.080
They had a great time.
他们确实玩得很开心。

670
00:28:03.660 --> 00:28:06.060
Mom, I'm sorry I went to a bar that was inside a church.
妈，对不起，我去了开在教堂里的酒吧。

671
00:28:06.180 --> 00:28:06.920
Mom, I'm sorry.
妈，对不起。

672
00:28:07.540 --> 00:28:14.620
Well, listen, Ange, also during this talking head, Jim says that they think they saw Lorne Michaels.
好吧，听着，安吉，在这次单人访谈里，吉姆还说他们觉得自己看到了洛恩·迈克尔斯。

673
00:28:15.020 --> 00:28:15.420
Yeah.
是啊。

674
00:28:15.800 --> 00:28:18.420
And we got a lot of fan questions about that.
我们收到了很多关于这方面的粉丝提问。

