00:28:18.640 --> 00:28:31.620
From Angela A., Allie S., Kirsten O., Tyler N., Heather C., and many more all want to know, is the man that walks behind Jim Lorne Michaels?
来自安吉拉·A.、阿莉·S.、基斯顿·O.、泰勒·N.、希瑟·C. 还有许多其他人，都想知道走在吉姆身后那个人是洛恩·迈克尔斯吗？

676
00:28:31.780 --> 00:28:35.120
Was that a little cameo joke?
那是一个小小的客串彩蛋吗？

677
00:28:35.660 --> 00:28:36.180
No.
不是。

678
00:28:36.460 --> 00:28:36.560
No.
不是。

679
00:28:36.680 --> 00:28:37.360
It's not Lorne Michaels.
那不是洛恩·迈克尔斯。

680
00:28:37.660 --> 00:28:38.560
I zoomed in.
我放大看过了。

681
00:28:38.700 --> 00:28:41.020
It's definitely, definitely not Lorne Michaels.
绝对、绝对不是洛恩·迈克尔斯。

682
00:28:41.480 --> 00:28:47.640
I like to think that Jim is someone who thinks he recognizes famous people places, but they're just normal folks.
我觉得吉姆就是那种总觉得自己认出了名人，但其实对方只是普通人的人。

683
00:28:50.340 --> 00:28:53.800
I feel like my sister Tina does that.
我觉得我姐姐蒂娜也会这样。

684
00:28:54.000 --> 00:28:56.040
You know, she'd be like, that's Angelina Jolie.
你知道的，她会说，看那是安吉丽娜·朱莉。

685
00:28:56.180 --> 00:28:59.500
I'm like, why would Angelina Jolie be in the mall in our hometown right now?
我说，安吉丽娜·朱莉凭什么现在会出现在我们家乡的商场里？

686
00:29:01.020 --> 00:29:02.200
Yes, exactly.
对，完全是这样。

687
00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:07.840
Well, you know, another thing that happens here is that Karen kind of confronts Jim.
好吧，你知道的，这里发生的另一件事是凯伦质问了吉姆。

688
00:29:08.320 --> 00:29:08.620
Yeah.
是啊。

689
00:29:08.740 --> 00:29:13.040
